  "description": "Buckley Real Estate are proud to bring this modern 1 bedroom apartment to the Dublin lettings market. This bright and spacious 1 bedroom apartment in this popular development commanding lovely south facing views with floor to ceiling windows out towards the Dublin mountains.\n\nThe accommodation comprises entrance hall, hotpress/storage, bathroom with whb, wc and bath with overhead shower, double bedroom with built in wardrobes, lounge/dining room and kitchen. The balcony can be accessed from the bedroom and living room.\n\nThe property is in a perfect location adjacent to Tallaght Town Centre, the LUAS and a host amenities including grocery stores, coffee shops, restaurants and bars. The Square shopping centre is also only a short stroll away. There is also a host of recreational activities nearby such as numerous gyms and Tallaght Stadium is only a 5 minute walk from the development.\n\nThe property also comes located in a well service public transport area with numerous Dublin Bus routes and the Luas servicing the area.",
